    "text": "A particle is moving in the <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></math>-plane along a curve <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math> passing through the point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>. The tangent to the curve <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math> at the point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math> meets the <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>-axis at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi></math>. If the <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi></math>-axis bisects the segment <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math> is a parabola with",
