  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let Point&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>So equation of line passing through&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;will be</p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>X</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Point on <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>-axis is given by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Mid-point of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi></math> lies on <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi></math>&nbsp;axis so its&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;co-ordinate will be zero,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>y</mi><mi>m</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>y</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mi>y</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mi>x</mi></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>lnn</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>ln</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>ln</mi><mi>k</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>It passes through&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p>curve&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>Length of L.R.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p>Focus<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p>",
